This repository vendors the decimal32, decimal64 and decimal128 files of the
General Decimal Arithmetic test cases for use as a conformance corpus, under
testdata/dectest/. They are version 2.59, copied verbatim from the copy
distributed with CPython (Lib/test/decimaltestdata):

    General Decimal Arithmetic Testcases
    https://speleotrove.com/decimal/dectest.html
    Copyright (c) IBM Corporation, 1981-2008
    Licensed under the ICU License; see testdata/dectest/LICENSE

They are used unmodified and for testing only. No code in this repository is
derived from them or from the decNumber library.
